      "describe": "Formalize custody of the restored KX-91.",
      "offer": "The aircraft is operational, but it is still on AXIOM's books. Nadia and Security have signed their releases. I can sign the last one if you perform a custody handshake on the flight deck. That proves the aircraft accepts your operator identity before we remove it from faction inventory.",
